{"steam_appid":3076400,"steam_name":"Tech Store Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3076400/748427/69afd8a0928cbb6f030bbac28da7539cd694311e/1750972865/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1725006353","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257050843/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1725006353","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/ss_500bc9ec1d24beb062d065e2343fc01f7e9bce37.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738220533","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/ss_de7535c4d7fce9e270991fa4ec271dc6c42d73e7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738220533","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/ss_33a4788bbca956c58ebaeadca0caafe1e1b95d36.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738220533","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/ss_556bbd7625007ea52e32fd7e92ef8308b9129c51.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738220533","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/ss_67ae285934d36e8f53d20845a9a2e1cd4fab0e51.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738220533"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Tech Store Simulator&quot;</strong> is an engaging first-person simulation where every aspect of running an electronic shop comes to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your store</strong>, optimizing for both efficiency and aesthetics. Determine the best display for your tech gadgets, manage your aisles, and ensure a seamless shopping experience for your customers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/ab474119c6b3c1348b69c75662197d65.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/ab474119c6b3c1348b69c75662197d65.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/ab474119c6b3c1348b69c75662197d65.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Order stock using an in-game computer</strong>. Unpack the latest tech gadgets, organize them in your storage room, and strategically place them on shelves and displays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/5f3f87d9fe2fe3c2898ee32ae8eb2cb2.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/5f3f87d9fe2fe3c2898ee32ae8eb2cb2.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/5f3f87d9fe2fe3c2898ee32ae8eb2cb2.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Handle customer</strong> transactions by scanning items and making sure customers leave satisfied with their shopping and checkout experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/7b09e74c934bf170e0e36686ad7bc25e.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/7b09e74c934bf170e0e36686ad7bc25e.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/7b09e74c934bf170e0e36686ad7bc25e.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Be careful of thieves.</strong> Not all clients want you to make money. Some of them just want to pick up and run. In this case, only a magic kick will help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/2586684e305017854a4d81be142b75bc.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/2586684e305017854a4d81be142b75bc.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/2586684e305017854a4d81be142b75bc.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customers come in many forms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some clients will be nice to you, some not so nice, but you should be able to capitalize on all situations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/48b62e3c962bfb2d74fab11819cee619.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/48b62e3c962bfb2d74fab11819cee619.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/48b62e3c962bfb2d74fab11819cee619.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &quot;Tech Store Simulator&quot;, every decision matters.</strong> Will you rise to the occasion, transforming a modest tech store into a retail powerhouse, while balancing customer satisfaction and finances?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 860<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4000 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4000 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Astrasoft"],"publishers":["Astrasoft"],"release_date":"11 Oct, 2024"}